# Self-service variant: served through the workflow-maintainer portal account's
# own free-tier tunnel (a2a-demo.bunsenbrenner.org), while the tunnel is in Gelb
# (see CADS-Tunnel docs/agent-onboarding.md "Certificate status"). The edge
# terminates external TLS itself with a shared cert and relays plain HTTP to
# the origin -- so this listens on plain :80, no `tls` directive, until
# `ct-agent certificate` reaches Grün and this file gets updated to serve its
# own fullchain.pem/privkey.pem on :443 like the base Caddyfile does. Same
# pattern as CADS-webconference-demo's own Caddyfile.selfservice.
:80 {
	reverse_proxy a2a-demo-bridge:8790
	encode gzip
	header {
		X-Content-Type-Options "nosniff"
	}
}
